## 🔍 What Happened
**Characters:**
1. Sioned ferch Cai - She is currently standing at the shoreline in Avalon, holding a parchment with two mysterious words. She has a ledger that contains an entry she can't account for and is trying to find her way back before dawn. Her Devotion is THE TABLE.

