**Acting Character:**
Sioned ferch Cai - Sioned is a descendant of Kay/Cai ap Cynyr and has the Devotion of THE TABLE. She is a logistician who manages things effectively, reorganizing supply chains and resolving disputes quickly. However, she also keeps a ledger with an entry that predates her family and is written in an unknown language. In this scene, Sioned has taken it upon herself to close this account by finding the three figures at the water's edge and negotiating the payment for the debt. She plans to leave before dawn but must act quickly as something is already following her in Avalon.

